# ─── Markdown ───
# Agent sessions scatter scratch .md files (plans, notes, summaries). Markdown is
# ignored by default and the maintained documents are allow-listed below. To add a
# new document, add its exception here in the same commit, or `git add -f` once.
# Note: files already tracked are unaffected by these rules.
*.md
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!SYSTEM-ARCHITECTURE.md
!plan.md
!docs/architecture/MODULES.md
!docs/architecture/FOUNDATION-PLAN.md
!docs/architecture/RULES-AND-POLICIES.md
!docs/architecture/ASSUMPTIONS.md
!docs/architecture/TEARDOWN-PLAN.md
!docs/architecture/DATA-MODEL-REVIEW.md
!docs/architecture/EDGE-CASES.md
!docs/architecture/schema/README.md
!.agent/rules/*.md
!docs/ai-disclosure.md
!docs/architecture.md
!docs/code-structure.md
!docs/data-model.md
!docs/deployment.md
!docs/design-mapping.md
!docs/design-rationale.md
!docs/development-docs/development.md
!docs/development-docs/development-log.md
!docs/development-docs/enterprise-architecture-plan.md
!docs/submission-checklist.md
!docs/verification.md

